f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Hale County record runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, May to June, June to July and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September came in at 27% of normal on the middle of the grids, and May to June ran 235%. Grid 15770 had its driest year in 2007 at 57%, while the other grids listed all had theirs in 1954.</p>"}
